{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"联合"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"联合"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>范畴中两个对象 $X,Y$ 的<strong>联合</strong> (join) $X * Y$ 是如下的"},{"Local":{"url":"推出","text":"推出"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\nX * Y = X \\sqcup_{X\\times Y} Y.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>纬悬</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"纬悬","text":"纬悬"}},{"Plain":"是与 $S^0 = 1 + 1$ 的联合:\n$$\r\nS^0 * A = (1+1) \\sqcup_{A + A} A = 1 \\sqcup_A 1 = \\Sigma A.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>由此归纳得\n$$\r\n\\underbrace{S^0 * S^0 * \\cdots * S^0}_n = S^{n-1}.\r\n$$\n$$\r\nS^n * S^m = S^{n+m+1}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>连通性</h3>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 设 $X$ 是 $n$-连通生象, $Y$ 是 $m$-连通生象, 那么 $X*Y$ 是 $(n+m+2)$-连通生象.</p>\n"}]}}